WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.083
Legion took this issue to done:

00:00:03.299 --> 00:00:04.540
checked in production,

00:00:05.237 --> 00:00:06.223
and signed off.

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:08.897
To hand Legion an issue,

00:00:09.593 --> 00:00:10.737
add the legion label

00:00:11.879 --> 00:00:13.672
and set it to Todo.

00:00:13.848 --> 00:00:16.194
Legion admits it and claims it.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.770
The architect's questions come to your Inbox.

00:00:21.069 --> 00:00:21.792
Pick an answer,

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:24.614
and once every one is answered,

00:00:25.277 --> 00:00:28.035
it asks you to approve the spec.

00:00:29.497 --> 00:00:30.095
Approve it,

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:31.391
and it's clear.

00:00:33.072 --> 00:00:37.400
The status follows each phase, with no click from you.

00:00:38.721 --> 00:00:40.630
READY names the pull request,

00:00:40.818 --> 00:00:43.245
and what it changes, for your merge.
